sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Artisan
  participant AA as Artisan app
  participant FS as Cloud Firestore
  participant CF as Cloud Functions
  participant CA as Customer app
  actor C as Customer
  A->>AA: Open the request, enter price, arrival time and an optional message
  AA->>FS: Create offers/id (PENDING) and add one to request.offerCount
  FS-)CF: onOfferCreated
  CF->>FS: newOffer notification for the customer, push sent
  CA-->>C: Offers listed with price, arrival time and rating, featured first
  alt the customer declines an offer
    C->>CA: Decline with a reason
    CA->>FS: Offer REJECTED with REJECTED_BY_CUSTOMER and the reason
    FS-)CF: onOfferUpdated
    CF->>FS: offerRejected notification for that artisan
  else the customer accepts an offer
    C->>CA: Accept
    CA->>FS: One batch: offer ACCEPTED, other offers REJECTED (OTHER_ACCEPTED), request ACCEPTED with the hired artisan
    FS-)CF: onRequestUpdated and onOfferUpdated
    CF->>FS: offerAccepted notification for the hired artisan
    CF->>FS: offerNotChosen notifications for the other artisans
    Note over AA: The request leaves the other artisans' lists when their notification arrives
  end
